    "created_at": "2018-06-08T10:50:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-08T10:50:07Z",
    "body": "I once implemented advanced feature like this with JavaScript,\r\nand I want to mention, that `autoselect` would need make sure doesn't conflict when user tries to select part of the text (user **click**s the text in field and, while holding **keydown**, drags-moves (**mousemove**) the cursor - expected partly selected text, till position of **keyup**. Need to be sure it accepts also touch events.",
