    "created_at": "2020-10-26T20:45:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-26T20:45:12Z",
    "body": "Use case: \r\nWe have a form that includes a selecting a file and then pre-populating another input with the name of the selected file. Users can still edit this field (and most likely will), so I call `select()` to make it easier for the user to type a new name. \r\n\r\nIt would be really nice to put `autoselect` on this input and get the same behavior (a similar convenience as `autofocus` vs. calling `focus()` after page load).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
