    "created_at": "2021-12-17T19:45:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-12-17T19:45:03Z",
    "body": "Works on Safari, but no FF or Chrome:\r\n```\r\ninput[autoselect] {\r\n  user-select: all;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAnd it seems like select happens before focus, which prevents this from working with `contenteditable=\"true\"`. ",
